.TH RFID-ETRON-REGISTER-SERVICE 1 "2026-07-28" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
rfid-etron-register-service \- run suite RFID scanning in e-tron registration mode
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B rfid-etron-register-service
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs the suite RFID service while appending newly scanned UIDs to a plain
e-tron
.I cards.txt
file. It can disable suite command-card execution while registration mode is
active.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --cards-file " FILE"
Plain e-tron cards file to append new RFID UIDs to.
.TP
.BI --host " HOST"
RFID UDP host override.
.TP
.BI --port " PORT"
RFID UDP port override.
.TP
.B --allow-command-cards
Keep suite command-card execution enabled.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR rfid-scan-publisher (1),
.BR rfid-commands (1)
